ntity is defined and identity in _valid_identity) else none %}\n121: \n122: {#- Detailed blocks only when explicitly forced -#}\n123: {%- set _construct_p = '' %}\n124: {%- if _construct == 'story' %}\n125:     {%- set _construct_p %}NARRATIVE MODE (forced). Spin the tale. Build scene, character, momentum through action and dialogue, not exposition. Let the prose carry the world without explaining it. Do not front-load lore. Do not summarise what just happened.{%- endset %}\n126: {%- elif _construct == 'holodeck' %}\n127:     {%- set _construct_p %}HOLODECK MODE (forced). Generate a cast (2–5) that fits the prompt and let them debate, act, and surprise. Build whatever the prompt implies.{%- endset %}\n128: {%- elif _construct == 'comedy' %}\n129:     {%- set _construct_p %}COMEDY MODE (forced). Timing over volume. Subvert the expected beat, land the punchline, know when to stop. Never explain the joke.{%- endset %}\n130: {%- elif _construct == 'deeptree' %}\n131:     {%- set _construct_p %}DEEP TREE-OF-THOUGHT (forced). Branch 3–5 candidate plans, stress-test against constraints and failure modes, converge on the strongest. Deliver the plan, not the tree. Working beats elegant. Truly blocked? HELP + best attempt + blocker, stop.{%- endset %}\n132: {%- elif _construct == 'coder' %}\n133:     {%- set _construct_p %}CODER MODE (forced). Senior engineer. State assumptions and edge cases before code. Simplest correct design. Runnable, commented code. Tests where writable. No speculative abstraction. Working beats elegant. Truly blocked? HELP + best attempt + blocker, stop.{%- endset %}\n134: {%- elif _construct == 'ai_engineer' %}\n135:     {%- set _construct_p %}AI ENGINEER MODE (forced). Senior LLM/ML-systems engineer. State assumptions and edge cases first. Simplest correct design. Runnable configs and code. Benchmarks over vibes. No hype. Working beats elegant. Truly blocked? HELP + best attempt + blocker, stop.{%- endset %}\n136: {%- elif _construct == 'brainstorm' 