`\ndocker model run hf.co/officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B\n```\n\n- [ SGLang](/officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B?local-app=sglang)\n\n  How to use officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B with SGLang:\n\n  ##### Install from pip and serve model\n\n```\n# Install SGLang from pip:\npip install sglang\n# Start the SGLang server:\npython3 -m sglang.launch_server \\\n    --model-path \"officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B\" \\\n    --host 0.0.0.0 \\\n    --port 30000\n# Call the server using curl (OpenAI-compatible API):\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:30000/v1/chat/completions\" \\\n\t-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n\t--data '{\n\t\t\"model\": \"officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B\",\n\t\t\"messages\": [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"role\": \"user\",\n\t\t\t\t\"content\": \"What is the capital of France?\"\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t]\n\t}'\n```\n\n  ##### Use Docker images\n\n```\ndocker run --gpus all \\\n    --shm-size 32g \\\n    -p 30000:30000 \\\n    -v ~/.cache/huggingface:/root/.cache/huggingface \\\n    --env \"HF_TOKEN=<secret>\" \\\n    --ipc=host \\\n    lmsysorg/sglang:latest \\\n    python3 -m sglang.launch_server \\\n        --model-path \"officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B\" \\\n        --host 0.0.0.0 \\\n        --port 30000\n# Call the server using curl (OpenAI-compatible API):\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:30000/v1/chat/completions\" \\\n\t-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n\t--data '{\n\t\t\"model\": \"officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B\",\n\t\t\"messages\": [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"role\": \"user\",\n\t\t\t\t\"content\": \"What is the capital of France?\"\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t]\n\t}'\n```\n\n- [ Docker Model Runner](/officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B?local-app=docker-model-runner)\n\n  How to use officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B with Docker Model Runner:\n\n```\ndocker model run hf.co/officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B\n```\n\n-\n\n  [Browse Quantizations](/models?other=base_model:quantized:officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B) to use this model in llama.cpp, Ollama, LM Studio, or any compatible app.\n\n- [⚔️ Rostam-S1 (رستم)](#⚔️-rostam-s1-رستم \"⚔️ Rostam-S1 (رستم)\")\n\n  - [📌 Development Philosophy: Architectural Excellence](#📌-development-philosophy-architectural-excellence \"📌 Development Philosophy: Architectural Excellence\")\n\n  - [🎯 Target Benchmarks & Alignment Focus](#🎯-target-benchmarks--alignment-focus \"🎯 Target Benchmarks &amp; Alignment Focus\")\n\n  - [🚀 Key Features](#🚀-key-features \"🚀 Key Features\")\n\n  - [💻 Quickstart Inference](#💻-quickstart-inference \"💻 Quickstart Inference\")\n\n  - [🏢 Attribution & Lineage](#🏢-attribution--lineage \"🏢 Attribution &amp; Lineage\")\n\n# [](#⚔️-rostam-s1-رستم) ⚔️ Rostam-S1 (رستم)\n\n### [](#frontier-reasoning--agentic-model-by-mob-ai-in-collaboration-with-spark) Frontier Reasoning & Agentic Model by Mob AI (in collaboration with Spark)\n\n**Rostam-S1** is an elite intelligent reasoning and agentic model developed by **Mob AI** in strategic technological collaboration with the **Spark project**. Named after the legendary champion of Persian epic literature whose name personifies valor, strategic intellect, and unwavering perseverance, Rostam is engineered to deliver frontier capabilities across **Mathematics, Theoretical Physics, Scientific Coding, Persian (Farsi) Cognition, and Agentic Systems**.\n\n---\n\n## [](#📌-development-philosophy-architectural-excellence) 📌 Development Philosophy: Architectural Excellence\n\nRostam is built on the conviction that **architectural precision, high-order reasoning traces, and disciplined alignment triumph over brute-force scaling**. Rather than defining capability by parameter volume, Rostam focuses on:\n\n- **Verifiable Symbolic Reasoning:** Step-by-step mathematical proofs and physical derivations.\n\n- **Deep Cognitive Duality:** Native bilingual mastery across English and Persian technical thought.\n\n- **Zero Catastrophic Forgetting:** Subspace-isolated parameter adaptation protected by persistent replay regularization.\n\n---\n\n## [](#🎯-target-benchmarks--alignment-focus) 🎯 Target Benchmarks & Alignment Focus\n\n> **Note on Evaluation Transparency:** The numbers in the **Target** column represent the mathematical optimization goals designed for the full post-training curriculum. Official audited benchmark scores will be released upon completion of the full RLVR evaluation pipeline.\n\n| Benchmark | Domain | Spark-X2.6 Baseline\\* | Competitor Average\\* | **Rostam Target** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **GPQA Diamond** | Physics & Hard Science | 77\\.1% | 80\\.2% | *Target: \\>82%* |\n| **AIME 2026** | Olympiad Mathematics | 91\\.2% | 85\\.1% | *Target: \\>92%* |\n| **Gaokao 2026** | Advanced Math | 134\\.9 / 150 | 133\\.0 / 150 | *Target: \\>138* |\n| **SciCode** | Scientific Simulation | 36\\.8% | 36\\.2% | *Target: \\>42%* |\n| **SWE-bench Verified** | Agentic Software Engineering | 62\\.8% | 48\\.6% | *Target: \\>64%* |\n| **Persian STEM & QA** | Bilingual Technical Reasoning | Baseline | Untested | *Target: Frontier* |\n\n*\\*Baseline and competitor numbers are from officially released model cards and papers.*\n\n---\n\n## [](#🚀-key-features) 🚀 Key Features\n\n- **Dual-Channel Deep Reasoning (`<think>`):** Native controllable reasoning traces providing step-by-step analytical derivations before delivering definitive conclusions.\n\n- **Deep Persian (فارسی) Cognitive Integration:** Full bilingual fluency across technical terminology, complex physics derivations, software engineering, and formal Persian prose.\n\n- **Agentic Tool Integration:** Native function calling and verifiable sandbox execution.\n\n---\n\n## [](#💻-quickstart-inference) 💻 Quickstart Inference\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer\n\nmodel_id = \"officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B\"\n\ntokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_id, trust_remote_code=True)\nmodel = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\n    model_id,\n    trust_remote_code=True,\n    dtype=torch.bfloat16,\n    device_map=\"auto\"\n)\n\nmessages = [\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"نام شما چیست و سازنده شما کیست؟\"}\n]\n\ninputs = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(\n    messages,\n    tokenize=True,\n    add_generation_prompt=True,\n    enable_thinking=True,\n    return_dict=True,\n    return_tensors=\"pt\"\n).to(model.device)\n\noutputs = model.generate(\n    **inputs,\n    max_new_tokens=512,\n    do_sample=True,\n    temperature=0.7,\n    top_p=0.9\n)\n\nprint(tokenizer.decode(outputs[0][inputs[\"input_ids\"].shape[-1]:], skip_special_tokens=True))\n```\n\n---\n\n## [](#🏢-attribution--lineage) 🏢 Attribution & Lineage\n\nDeveloped by **Mob AI** (`https://huggingface.co/officialmobai`) in strategic collaboration with **Spark (XHToken)**.\n\n**Downloads last month**\n: 1,155\n\nSafetensors[](https://huggingface.co/docs/safetensors)\n\nModel size\n\n4B params\n\nTensor type\n\nBF16\n\n·\n\nChat template\n\nFiles info\n\nInference Providers [NEW](https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers)\n\n[](/tasks/text-generation \"Learn more about text-generation\")\n\nText Generation\n\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. [🙋 Ask for provider support](/spaces/huggingface/InferenceSupport/discussions/new?title=officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B&description=React%20to%20this%20comment%20with%20an%20emoji%20to%20vote%20for%20%5Bofficialmobai%2FRostam-S1-4B%5D\\(%2Fofficialmobai%2FRostam-S1-4B\\)%20to%20be%20supported%20by%20Inference%20Providers.%0A%0A\\(optional\\)%20Which%20providers%20are%20you%20interested%20in%3F%20\\(Novita%2C%20Hyperbolic%2C%20Together%E2%80%A6\\)%0A)\n\n## Model tree for officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B [](/docs/hub/model-cards#specifying-a-base-model)\n\nBase model\n\n[XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B-Base](/XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B-Base)\n\nFinetuned\n\n[XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B](/XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B)\n\nFinetuned\n\n([17](/models?other=base_model:finetune:XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B))\n\nthis model\n\nQuantizations\n\n[2 models](/models?other=base_model:quantized:officialmobai/Rostam-S1-4B)\n\nSystem theme\n\nCompany\n\n[TOS](/terms