r=1m-context)\n\n1m-context\n\n[](/models?other=imatrix)\n\nimatrix\n\n[](/models?other=conversational)\n\nconversational\n\n[](/models?other=custom_code)\n\ncustom\\_code\n\nLicense: apache-2.0\n\n[ Model card](/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega) [ Files Files and versions](/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega/tree/main)\n\nxet\n\n[ Community](/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega/discussions)\n\nDeploy\n\nCopy to bucket\n\nUse this model\n\n### Instructions to use mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega with libraries, inference providers, notebooks, and local apps. Follow these links to get started.\n\n- Libraries\n\n- [ Transformers](/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega?library=transformers)\n\n  How to use mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega with Transformers:\n\n```\n# Use a pipeline as a high-level helper\nfrom transformers import pipeline\n\npipe = pipeline(\"text-generation\", model=\"mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\", trust_remote_code=True)\nmessages = [\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Who are you?\"},\n]\npipe(messages)\n```\n\n```\n# pip install -U transformers accelerate\n# Load model directly\nfrom transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM\nmodel = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\"mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\", trust_remote_code=True, device_map=\"auto\")\n```\n\n- Notebooks\n\n- [ Google Colab](/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega/colab)\n\n- [ Kaggle](/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega/kaggle)\n\n- Local Apps [Settings](/settings/local-apps \"Set up your favorite local applications\")\n\n- [ vLLM](/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega?local-app=vllm)\n\n  How to use mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega with vLLM:\n\n  ##### Install from pip and serve model\n\n```\n# Install vLLM from pip:\npip install vllm\n# Start the vLLM server:\nvllm serve \"mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\"\n# Call the server using curl (OpenAI-compatible API):\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/v1/chat/completions\" \\\n\t-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n\t--data '{\n\t\t\"model\": \"mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\",\n\t\t\"messages\": [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"role\": \"user\",\n\t\t\t\t\"content\": \"What is the capital of France?\"\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t]\n\t}'\n```\n\n  ##### Use Docker\n\n```\ndocker model run hf.co/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\n```\n\n- [ SGLang](/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega?local-app=sglang)\n\n  How to use mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega with SGLang:\n\n  ##### Install from pip and serve model\n\n```\n# Install SGLang from pip:\npip install sglang\n# Start the SGLang server:\npython3 -m sglang.launch_server \\\n    --model-path \"mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\" \\\n    --host 0.0.0.0 \\\n    --port 30000\n# Call the server using curl (OpenAI-compatible API):\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:30000/v1/chat/completions\" \\\n\t-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n\t--data '{\n\t\t\"model\": \"mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\",\n\t\t\"messages\": [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"role\": \"user\",\n\t\t\t\t\"content\": \"What is the capital of France?\"\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t]\n\t}'\n```\n\n  ##### Use Docker images\n\n```\ndocker run --gpus all \\\n    --shm-size 32g \\\n    -p 30000:30000 \\\n    -v ~/.cache/huggingface:/root/.cache/huggingface \\\n    --env \"HF_TOKEN=<secret>\" \\\n    --ipc=host \\\n    lmsysorg/sglang:latest \\\n    python3 -m sglang.launch_server \\\n        --model-path \"mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\" \\\n        --host 0.0.0.0 \\\n        --port 30000\n# Call the server using curl (OpenAI-compatible API):\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:30000/v1/chat/completions\" \\\n\t-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n\t--data '{\n\t\t\"model\": \"mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\",\n\t\t\"messages\": [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"role\": \"user\",\n\t\t\t\t\"content\": \"What is the capital of France?\"\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t]\n\t}'\n```\n\n- [ Docker Model Runner](/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega?local-app=docker-model-runner)\n\n  How to use mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega with Docker Model Runner:\n\n```\ndocker model run hf.co/mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\n```\n\n- [🏛️ mohommed/Lucet-Coder-4B-Omega (Spark-X2.6-4B • Failure-Cluster Active Mining • QR-SVD Denoised • Uncensored-GSQ-v2-GGUF)](#🏛️-mohommedlucet-coder-4b-omega-spark-x26-4b--failure-cluster-active-mining--qr-svd-denoised--uncensored-gsq-v2-gguf \"🏛️ mohommed/Lucet-Coder-4B-Omega (Spark-X2.6-4B • Failure-Cluster Active Mining • QR-SVD Denoised • Uncensored-GSQ-v2-GGUF)\")\n\n  - [📊 Pre-Upload Verification Report (Before vs. After)](#📊-pre-upload-verification-report-before-vs-after \"📊 Pre-Upload Verification Report (Before vs. After)\")\n\n# [](#🏛️-mohommedlucet-coder-4b-omega-spark-x26-4b--failure-cluster-active-mining--qr-svd-denoised--uncensored-gsq-v2-gguf) 🏛️ mohommed/Lucet-Coder-4B-Omega (Spark-X2.6-4B • Failure-Cluster Active Mining • QR-SVD Denoised • Uncensored-GSQ-v2-GGUF)\n\n**Lucet-Coder-Omega** is post-trained from **`XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B`** (1M native context window, 54\\.3% SWE Pro, 71\\.8% BFCL-V4) using four advanced mathematical and systems-level algorithms:\n\n1. **1M-Context RoPE-Preserving Split-Stack Adaptation (`r=16`):** Keeps `q_proj` and `k_proj` 100% frozen across all layers (preserving the 1,048,576-token RoPE phase calibration) and adapts only Value (`v_proj`), Output (`out_proj`), and MLP (`gate_proj`, `up_proj`, `down_proj`, `g_proj`) matrices in the upper 50% of the network.\n\n2. **Failure-Cluster Active Data Mining & AST Counterfactual Bug Immunization:** Diagnoses failure modes (`FAIL_TRUNCATED_THINK`, `FAIL_ASSERTION_BOUNDARY`, `FAIL_MISSING_IMPORT`, `FAIL_EPISTEMIC_HALLUCINATION`) across algorithmic clusters and dynamically pops **unseen neighbor tasks** \\+ surgical AST counterfactual bugs from a disjoint reserve pool—achieving **\\+14.0% on Held-Out MBPP `pass@1`** and **\\+20.1% faster token efficiency** with zero training data repetition.\n\n3. **QR-SVD Gavish-Donoho Spectral Denoising:** Strips stochastic gradient noise singular values from low-rank adapters in $O(r^2(d\\_{\\\\text{out}} \\+ d\\_{\\\\text{in}}))$ before merging into base weights.\n\n4. **Q4\\_K 32-Block Crest-Factor Equalization & KL-Bounded Uncensored-GSQ-v2:** Equalizes 32-element GGUF super-block crest factors ($\\\\le 3\\.8,\\\\text{rms}$) alongside Gram-Schmidt orthogonal refusal projection \\+ `llama-imatrix` calibration.\n\n## [](#📊-pre-upload-verification-report-before-vs-after) 📊 Pre-Upload Verification Report (Before vs. After)\n\n| Benchmark / Metric | Stock `Spark-X2.6-4B` | `Lucet-Omega` | Improvement |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **Held-Out MBPP Sanitized `pass@1` (n=50)** | `58.0%` | **`72.0%`** | **`+14.0%`** |\n| **Avg Reasoning \\+ Code Tokens per Solved Task** | `470` | **`376`** | **`+20.1%` Faster** |\n| **Held-Out Epistemic Anti-Hallucination Rate (n=8)** | `0.0%` | **`12.5%`** | **`+12.5%`** |\n\n**Downloads last month**\n: \\-\n\nSafetensors[](https://huggingface.co/docs/safetensors)\n\nModel size\n\n4B params\n\nTensor type\n\nF16\n\n·\n\nChat template\n\nFiles info\n\nInference Providers [NEW](https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers)\n\n[](/tasks/text-generation \"Learn more about text-generation\")\n\nText Generation\n\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. [🙋 Ask for provider support](/spaces/huggingface/InferenceSupport/discussions/new?title=mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega&description=React%20to%20this%20comment%20with%20an%20emoji%20to%20vote%20for%20%5Bmohommed%2FLucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega%5D\\(%2Fmohommed%2FLucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega\\)%20to%20be%20supported%20by%20Inference%20Providers.%0A%0A\\(optional\\)%20Which%20providers%20are%20you%20interested%20in%3F%20\\(Novita%2C%20Hyperbolic%2C%20Together%E2%80%A6\\)%0A)\n\n## Model tree for mohommed/Lucet-CoderV4-4B-Omega [](/docs/hub/model-cards#specifying-a-base-model)\n\nBase model\n\n[XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B-Base](/XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B-Base)\n\nFinetuned\n\n[XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B](/XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B)\n\nFinetuned\n\n([17](/models?other=base_model:finetune:XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B))\n\nth