 d\\_{\\\\text{in}}))$ before merging into base weights.\n\n4. **Q4\\_K 32-Block Crest-Factor Equalization & KL-Bounded Uncensored-GSQ-v2:** Equalizes 32-element GGUF super-block crest factors ($\\\\le 3\\.8,\\\\text{rms}$) alongside Gram-Schmidt orthogonal refusal projection \\+ `llama-imatrix` calibration.\n\n## [](#📊-pre-upload-verification-report-before-vs-after) 📊 Pre-Upload Verification Report (Before vs. After)\n\n| Benchmark / Metric | Stock `Spark-X2.6-4B` | `Lucet-Omega` | Improvement |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **Held-Out MBPP Sanitized `pass@1` (n=50)** | `58.0%` | **`72.0%`** | **`+14.0%`** |\n| **Avg Reasoning \\+ Code Tokens per Solved Task** | `470` | **`376`** | **`+20.1%` Faster** |\n| **Held-Out Epistemic Anti-Hallucination Rate (n=8)** | `0.0%` | **`12.5%`** | **`+12.5%`** |\n\n**Downloads last month**\n: \\-\n\nSafetensors[](https://huggingface.co/docs/safetensors)\n\nModel size\n\n4B params\n\nTensor type\n\nF16\n\n·\n\nChat template\n\nFiles info\n\nInference Providers [NEW](https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers)\n\n[](/tasks/text-generation \"Learn more about text-generation\")\n\nText Generation\n\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. [🙋 Ask for provider support](/spaces/huggingface/InferenceSupport/discussions/new?title=mohommed/Lucet-CoderV6-4B-Omega&description=React%20to%20this%20comment%20with%20an%20emoji%20to%20vote%20for%20%5Bmohommed%2FLucet-CoderV6-4B-Omega%5D\\(%2Fmohommed%2FLucet-CoderV6-4B-Omega\\)%20to%20be%20supported%20by%20Inference%20Providers.%0A%0A\\(optional\\)%20Which%20providers%20are%20you%20interested%20in%3F%20\\(Novita%2C%20Hyperbolic%2C%20Together%E2%80%A6\\)%0A)\n\n## Model tree for mohommed/Lucet-CoderV6-4B-Omega [](/docs/hub/model-cards#specifying-a-base-model)\n\nBase model\n\n[XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B-Base](/XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B-Base)\n\nFinetuned\n\n[XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B](/XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B)\n\nFinetuned\n\n([17](/models?other=base_model:finetune:XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B))\n\nth