          "text": "Excellent! I now have detailed info on:\n\n1. **Rostam-S1-4B** (officialmobai) - Frontier reasoning & agentic, dual-channel deep reasoning, Persian bilingual, zero catastrophic forgetting via subspace isolation + replay regularization. Built on Spark-X2.6-4B base. Targets: GPQA Diamond >82%, AIME >92%, Gaokao >138, SciCode >42%, SWE-bench >64%.\n\n2. **Lucet-CoderV4/V6/CoderSense-4B-Omega** (mohommed) - All same model card. Spark-X2.6-4B post-trained with:\n   - 1M-Context RoPE-Preserving Split-Stack Adaptation (r=16): freeze q_proj/k_proj, adapt v_proj/out_proj/MLP in upper 50% layers\n   - Failure-Cluster Active Data Mining & AST Counterfactual Bug Immunization (+14% MBPP, +20.1% token efficiency)\n   - QR-SVD Gavish-Donoho Spectral Denoising\n   - Q4_K 32-Block Crest-Factor Equalization + KL-Bounded Uncensored-GSQ-v2 (GSQ + RCO!)\n   - Tags: gsq, rco, qr-svd, ast-counterfactual, failure-cluster-mining, uncensored, 1m-context, imatrix\n   - MBPP 58%→72%, reasoning tokens 470→376, epistemic anti-hallucination 0%→12.5%\n   - Base: XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B (1M native context, 54.3% SWE Pro, 71.8% BFCL-V4)\n\n3. **Draftfit-DSpark-Autoresearch** (jayyun98) - Speculative decoding draft model (0.6B), acceptance 37.93%→40.11%\n\n4. **SQL-Cypher-Agent** (trjxter) - LoRA fine-tune, 94,745 examples (66M tokens), LoRA rank 16/alpha 32, +10.7 points execution accuracy, thinking budget 1024 tokens\n\n5. **CED** (darioooooo0o) - Causal Encoder-Decoder split from DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash paper (arXiv 2609.19969), prefill optimization ~1.5-2x speedup, split at layer 24, closed-form ridge regression + LoRA distillation\n\n6. **EAGLE-3** (VitreousCut) - One-layer EAGLE-3 draft head (218M params), trained on 21.96M tokens (codeparrot-clean, Magicoder, WikiText-103, UltraChat-200k), relabelling on verifier argmax, training-time test, ~2.57x throughput on CPU placement\n\nNow let me fetch more models. I still need to check:\n- denjhang/Spark-X2.5-4B-Therapy-EfficientThink-SF