步：TdrDelay 注册表解锁 8K 序列 \\+ DPO 偏好对（数据已备好），或以此为底座继续调\n\n## [](#使用) 使用\n\n```\nllama-server -m spark-therapy-q8_0.gguf --jinja -ngl 99 -c 65536 -fa on --temp 0.6 --top-p 0.95 --top-k 20\n```\n\n需要支持 `spark2_5` 架构的 llama.cpp（2026-10 后主线）。Q8\\_0 单档，低比特未验证（可能复发死循环）。\n\n## [](#致谢) 致谢\n\n- [XHToken](https://huggingface.co/XHToken) · 好底座\n\n- Merkyor · 剂量三定律与\"诚实披露失败\"的榜样\n\n- Qwen3.8-Flash-Next · 本地免费教师\n\n**Downloads last month**\n: 44\n\nGGUF[](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/gguf)\n\nModel size\n\n4B params\n\nArchitecture\n\nspark2\\_5\n\nChat template\n\nHardware compatibility\n\n[Log In](/login) to add your hardware\n\n8-bit\n\nQ8\\_0\n\n4\\.38 GB\n\nInference Providers [NEW](https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers)\n\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. [🙋 Ask for provider support](/spaces/huggingface/InferenceSupport/discussions/new?title=denjhang/Spark-X2.5-4B-Therapy-EfficientThink-SFT&description=React%20to%20this%20comment%20with%20an%20emoji%20to%20vote%20for%20%5Bdenjhang%2FSpark-X2.5-4B-Therapy-EfficientThink-SFT%5D\\(%2Fdenjhang%2FSpark-X2.5-4B-Therapy-EfficientThink-SFT\\)%20to%20be%20supported%20by%20Inference%20Providers.%0A%0A\\(optional\\)%20Which%20providers%20are%20you%20interested%20in%3F%20\\(Novita%2C%20Hyperbolic%2C%20Together%E2%80%A6\\)%0A)\n\n## Model tree for denjhang/Spark-X2.5-4B-Therapy-EfficientThink-SFT [](/docs/hub/model-cards#specifying-a-base-model)\n\nBase model\n\n[XHToken/Spark-X2.5-4B-Base](/XHToken/Spark-X2.5-4B-Base)\n\nFinetuned\n\n[XHToken/Spark-X2.5-4B](/XHToken/Spark-X2.5-4B)\n\nAdapter\n\n([2](/models?other=base_model:adapter:XHToken/Spark-X2.5-4B))\n\nthis model\n\nSystem theme\n\nCompany\n\n[TOS](/terms-of-service) [Privacy](/privacy) [About](/huggingface) [Careers](https://apply.workable.com/huggingface/) [](/)\n\nWebsite\n\n[Models](/models) [Datasets](/datasets) [Spaces](/spaces) [Pricing](/pricing) [Docs](/docs)"
